    "result_text": "Full build is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 0 failures/errors).\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded `contactPreference` = `EMAIL` when an email is present, otherwise `PHONE`, to the owner response.\n\nI followed the existing pattern for response-time derived read-only fields (`locality`, `membershipLevel`) \u2014 a pure getter on the model plus a schema property that MapStruct auto-maps \u2014 rather than adding a new OfficeFloor `Derive` step and wiring it into pipelines. Since the value derives purely from the persisted `email`, this correctly covers both `POST /api/owners` and `GET /api/owners/{id}` responses with no pipeline changes.\n\nChanges:\n- **`src/main/java/.../model/Owner.java`** \u2014 added a derived `getContactPreference()` getter returning `\"EMAIL\"` when `email` is non-null/non-empty, else `\"PHONE\"`.\n- **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the `contactPreference` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` carries it and MapStruct maps it automatically.\n\nBoth new acceptance tests (`corePhoneWhenNoEmail`, `functionalityEmailWhenPresent`) and the rest of the suite pass.",
